{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482/events","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1482","id":49609651,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0OTYwOTY1MQ==","number":1482,"title":"no-undef: Incorrectly warns about typeof UndefinedIdentifier statements","user":{"login":"iskitz","id":207487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzQ4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz","html_url":"https://github.com/iskitz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iskitz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":45711350,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTcxMTM1MA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":"ESLint is working incorrectly"},{"id":45798639,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTc5ODYzOQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/rule","name":"rule","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"Relates to ESLint's core rules"},{"id":131106229,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzExMDYyMjk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/accepted","name":"accepted","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":"There is consensus among the team that this change meets the criteria for inclusion"},{"id":829215248,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4MjkyMTUyNDg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/labels/archived%20due%20to%20age","name":"archived due to age","color":"eeeeee","default":false,"description":"This issue has been archived; please open a new issue for any further discussion"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2014-11-20T19:47:06Z","updated_at":"2018-02-07T01:47:12Z","closed_at":"2014-11-25T20:35:40Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":":+1: for creating ESLint, love the concept of making these rules truly configurable. Unfortunately, I've run into an annoyance that may actually be a bug\n\n| ... | ... |\n| --- | --- |\n| **version** | 0.9.2 |\n| **rule** | [no-undef](http://eslint.org/docs/rules/no-undef.html) |\n| **code** | [typeof](http://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/5.1/#sec-11.4.3) UndefinedIdentifier |\n| **expected** | No warning |\n| **observed** | `[no-undef] 'UndefinedIdentifier' is not defined.` |\n\nESLint throws the warning above when linting code that checks for an identifier using this pattern\n\n``` javascript\nif (typeof UndefinedIdentifier === 'undefined') {\n    /* do something */\n}\n```\n\nThe warning also occurs for this simpler yet equally [valid](http://www.ecma-international.org/ecma-262/5.1/#sec-11.4) statement\n\n``` javascript\ntypeof UndefinedIdentifier;\n```\n\nI value ESLint's undefined warnings but prefer they only occur for code that doesn't explicitly check for just that. Disabling the `no-undef` warning or explicitly declaring each undefined identifier via `/*global ...*/` is impractical for me so I'm hoping this will be fixed . . . soon ;-)\n\nThanks!\n","closed_by":{"login":"lo1tuma","id":169170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTE3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lo1tuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lo1tuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1482/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}